r. Samuel Prapthik<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A certified Implantologist and Laser specialist with an experience of 16 years, Dr. Prapthik practices at Dr. Stephen Memorial Dental Clinic in Tuticorin and also runs clinics in Coimbatore. Patients appreciate the great knowledge that he holds, the wide range of dental treatment options being offered, and performing such interventions while making it as painless as possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">04. Dr. P. Pasupathi<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Practice Shine Dental Centre, Sivananda Colony, Coimbatore, Dr. Pasupathi comes with 17 years of experience to his credit in dental practice. He is a BDS and has some astonishing patient satisfaction numbers. His dental center is reputed to be affordable and offers personalized care so that the patient may gain the best treatment regarding his or her dental problem.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">05. Dr. Abhishek John Samuel<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With an experience of fifteen years of dentistry practice, Dr. Samuel is commonly considered an Endodontist. He practices at Park-West Family Dentistry in Saibaba Colony, Coimbatore. Patients reviewed him as conducted painless dental procedures, especially the root canal treatments, and applauded the dentist for being sensitive towards the patients as well as explaining to them the treatment processes made in detail.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So, it is very important to choose the right TMJ specialist in Coimbatore who can diagnose and treat your condition to get the required symptomatic relief. After all, taking into account the qualifications, experience, patient reviews, technological advancements, and also personal comfort can help you arrive at a conclusion for selecting a specialist that meets your specific needs, thereby achieving a path towards relief and better oral health.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Among these, Prof. Dr.Dhivya Dilipkumar stands out because she is highly competent in orthodontics as well as TMJ pain management, which makes her one of the distinguished figures that is associated with this particular area of expertise. These other mentioned factors will also help you make an informed decision so that you can get quality health for your TMJ disorder, which will provide relief and better oral health.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So people of Coimbatore, are you ready to make the right choice for your oral health?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">TMJ Specialists in Coimbatore FAQs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Who is the best TMJ specialist in Coimbatore?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Prof Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar is one of the best and certified TMJ specialist in Coimbatore with 15 years of experience. You can all this number <em>8248388593<\/em> to book an appointment. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What are the common symptoms of TMJ disorders?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Common symptoms include Pain or tenderness of the jaw, difficulty chewing, aching facial pain, locking of joint making it difficult to open or close your mouth, and clicking or grating sounds in the jaw joint when opening or closing your mouth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Do TMJ disorders go away on their own?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some TMJ disorders may get better without treatment. But for cases that last more than a few weeks or where the symptoms are severe, professional evaluation and treatment are required to prevent the condition from worsening or leading to pain and functional difficulty.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What are the other means of treating TMJ disorders without an operation?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Other means involve medication to relieve pain and lessen inflammation, physical therapy, using oral splints or mouth guards, and seeking ways to manage stress. More advanced treatment is warranted in serious cases.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How long would treatment take for TMJ disorders?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The length of time for treatment to cure TMJ disorders is quite different for many patients due to the more advanced nature of a particular condition, as well as the plan of treatment that has been taken, and also the response to treatment. Some patients may get some relief from treatment given within one or two months, while others will require more extended periods of treatment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Are there any lifestyle changes that can help manage TMJ disorders?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Indeed, lifestyle modifications such as reduction of stress techniques, avoiding excessive movements of the jaw (like gum chewing and yawning), eating soft foods, as well as practicing jaw-stretching exercises can be useful in the management of TMJ symptoms. Good postures should be maintained as well as avoiding resting your chin on your hand.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Book An Appointment Now!<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wpforms-container wpforms-container-full wpforms-block wpforms-block-0bcb7586-8a85-42bd-9f5a-679109d8bb6b\" id=\"wpforms-5022\"><form id=\"wpforms-form-5022\" class=\"wpforms-validate wpforms-form wpforms-ajax-form\" data-formid=\"5022\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"multipart\/form-data\" action=\"\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4022\" data-token=\"5bf619bea3e8832e8061d81a1352463a\" data-token-time=\"1787810502\"><noscript class=\"wpforms-error-noscript\">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.<\/noscript><div class=\"wpforms-field-container\"><div id=\"wpforms-5022-field_2-conta